WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.433
This is a reproducibility study of Graph Edit Networks,

00:00:03.513 --> 00:00:10.907
a graph neural network output layer that predicts
how a graph changes over time as a sequence of interpretable edits.

00:00:10.987 --> 00:00:16.720
The reproduction re-implements the model and
re-tests the paper's four experimental claims.
